<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39555" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικᾰλύπτ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cover over, cover up, shroud</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸν δ᾽</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ κῶμα καλύπτει</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				798
			</span></i>; of snow <i>covering</i> a track, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν ἀπορίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Chrm.</u>
					169d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.106
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be covered over, veiled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐπωνυμία ἐπικεκάλυπται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					395b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαλύπτεσθαι τὸν νοῦν πάθει ἢ
				ὕπνῳ</span>
			<i>is darkened, obscured</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i>
			<i>de</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				429a7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>put as
				a covering over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλεφάρων φᾶρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					642
				</span></i>
			 codd. (lyr.):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν βλεφάρων
			-κεκαλυμμένων</span> when the eyelids <i>are drawn down</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				437a25
			</span></i>.</div>
